<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>異度家庭日 - The Office Abyss (V29 終極修復版)</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg-color: #0b0d14;
    --panel-bg: #141824;
    --accent: #ff4757;
    --text: #e0e6ed;
    --border: #262e40;
    --highlight: #2ed573;
    --gold: #ffa502;
    --player-theme: #ffa502;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; user-select: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }
  body {
    background-color: var(--bg-color);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Microsoft JhengHei", sans-serif;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    height: 100vh;
    height: 100dvh;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  header {
    background: #121520;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    height: 34px;
  }
  .header-title { font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.88rem; color: #ffa502; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .turn-banner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    background: #1a2030;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--player-theme);
    padding: 2px 10px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    height: 28px;
  }
  .player-tab-list { display: flex; gap: 4px; overflow-x: auto; white-space: nowrap; }
  .player-tab {
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    color: #a0aec0;
  }
  .player-tab.active-tab {
    border-color: var(--player-theme);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .game-layout {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    flex: 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
  }
  .center-canvas-wrapper {
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 220px;
    max-height: 50vh;
    max-height: 50dvh;
    position: relative;
    background: #06070a;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 2px;
  }
  canvas#gameCanvas {
    background: #0f121d;
    box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.85);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    max-height: 98%;
    max-width: 98%;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .bottom-dashboard {
    height: 46vh;
    height: 46dvh;
    background: var(--panel-bg);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    padding: 5px;
    gap: 5px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .dash-left-box {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 5px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .char-compact-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; }
  canvas#active-char-canvas { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid #3c445c; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .char-summary { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .char-name-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 0.76rem; font-weight: bold; }
  .hp-bar-container { background: #232733; border-radius: 3px; overflow: hidden; height: 7px; margin-top: 2px; border: 1px solid #3c445c; }
  .hp-bar-fill { height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #e74c3c, #2ed573); width: 100%; transition: width 0.3s ease; }
  .step-badge {
    background: #10141f;
    border: 1.5px solid #2ed573;
    color: #2ed573;
    padding: 3px 5px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    margin: 3px 0;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .step-badge.no-steps { border-color: #ff4757 !important; color: #ff4757 !important; background: rgba(255, 71, 87, 0.15) !important; }
  .stat-grid-compact { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2px; font-size: 0.65rem; margin-bottom: 3px; }
  .stat-pill { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); padding: 2px 3px; border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid #232a3a; }
  .stat-val { font-weight: bold; color: #ffa502; float: right; }
  .inline-inventory-box {
    background: #10141f;
    border: 1px solid #28324a;
    border-radius: 4px;
    max-height: 85px;
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 3px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3px;
